id: pm-47wuv8awpqvj
title: Render literal and root-layout tracker paths safely in SDK cache ignore rules
description: "Independent isolated Git reproduction on current build: ensurePmGitignore(repo,{pmRoot:repo}) writes .agents/pm rules, leaving root-layout runtime/cache unignored. A custom[1] tracker produces Git wildcard rules: custom[1]/runtime/cache is unignored and unrelated custom1/runtime/cache is ignored. Generate anchored literal rules for actual tracker location, preserving custom names, curated evidence and external-root no-op semantics."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: "area:sdk",custom-root,gitignore,init
created_at: "2026-10-21T11:44:27.604Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-21T13:38:44.743Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T13:38:43.928Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T13:38:43.928Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: Root-layout tracker caches are ignored at the repository root without hiding unrelated nested runtime paths; Git metacharacters and whitespace in tracker roots match only literal intended paths; default/custom/external roots retain their documented behavior; public helper and CLI initialization are verified with real Git
parent: pm-o2kc
risk: medium
confidence: 90
severity: medium
resolution: "Render literal/root-layout ignore and merge paths safely, preserve non-default merge fences, reject unrepresentable roots and replace polynomial suffix normalization with a backward scan."
expected_result: Configured tracker roots preserve intended literal Git scope and public SDK normalization remains responsive for long slash runs.
actual_result: "All linked commands and typecheck pass. The exact CodeQL keeper falls from9072.65ms before the fix to3ms afterward, below its unchanged1000ms ceiling. Final hosted security, static and full-source coverage plus re-requested bot review gate the merge."
affected_version: 2026.10.21
component: sdk/workspace
